[statement]
As `a-sole-candidate-holds-its-names-before-it-is-chosen`, through a
package's own name: `v`'s one candidate is `r` 1, so `r` 2 is passed over
when `r`, a real name, is decided first.

[repository]
P:b
V:1
D:v r

P:r
V:1
p:v=1

P:r
V:2

[request]
b

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install r 1
install b 1
